    "Take off the wings by cutting through the joint close to the body. Tuck each wing tip back over its shoulder joint.",
    "Take off the legs by cutting through the skin close to the body, bending each leg back to pop the joint, then cutting through the meat. Cut the thigh from the drumstick.",
